{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/discordnew.png?t=1746651041\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Attention: This game contains Jumpscares! (can disable it)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/find.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifFind.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your objective is to find the impostor doll, which will play with you to avoid being caught. Perform the following steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues and evidence that the impostor leaves behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study and analyze their movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discard candidates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the impostor before 9 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/meet.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/female_people.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/MALE_PEOPLE.png?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dolls have their own objectives, preferences, friendships, enmities, loves, and hatreds towards circumstances, events, or other dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/traps.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifTraps.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps will help you catch conservative dolls; perhaps tempting them by turning on music or a television will make them react, allowing you to better interpret their tastes and appreciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/trust.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifTrust.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not trust their actions; these dolls are much smarter than you think. They are capable of moving others from their place and annihilating other dolls in order to confuse you, especially if you do not know each doll well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might assume that everything is over if you find a single doll out of its box. However, it may not have moved on its own; another doll might have moved it, or even moved many others while it remains completely still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/door.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifDoor.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's extremely important that you keep the door closed; failing to do so could have catastrophic consequences, from letting the impostor escape to altering the order of your eliminations, or even preventing you from making it through the night.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Doll Impostor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/21f0b300158c91deb8a0940b709e79d84dfef066.jpg"},{"name":"Safe place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/79b1a61a362a86eae3847d2322544e25b887164a.jpg"},{"name":"Evie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/7df6f31e5315936b28e9a524aa9914fe12308919.jpg"},{"name":"Amy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/6b5964af09ebe06b9ec48655a19187eccea959ae.jpg"},{"name":"Bastian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/a454c33e4f4efe476556dcf0c2a2ab1e32380a53.jpg"},{"name":"Bella","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/4853424cc4b9cbac0c9061939b4ccd6aab664fc1.jpg"},{"name":"Bill","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/adf54b19c7b5c32f07a6bfd9a0f9d90aac455b87.jpg"},{"name":"Daisy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/ad852c67c3bee1e15fbd621d7f47dc80fbc3cf6f.jpg"},{"name":"Dolly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/9f436021257a97186960e44726c5542fbfc8f6fa.jpg"},{"name":"Flora","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3703680/7168a322daa31dd9a3a4408cb85096d01e700795.jpg"}],"total":29},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703680?t=1746651041","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/4e60a75b15493e6673f925a415832265f145fbb1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746651041","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/019d63e84d769724c0f3a35e0e1d82b52cc9a78b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746651041","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/019d63e84d769724c0f3a35e0e1d82b52cc9a78b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746651041","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>PUBLISH YOUR GAMES WITH US!</h1><p><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/publish.png?t=1746651041\" /></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/discordnew.png?t=1746651041\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Attention: This game contains Jumpscares! (can disable it)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/find.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifFind.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your objective is to find the impostor doll, which will play with you to avoid being caught. Perform the following steps:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find clues and evidence that the impostor leaves behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study and analyze their movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discard candidates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the impostor before 9 AM</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/meet.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/female_people.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/MALE_PEOPLE.png?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dolls have their own objectives, preferences, friendships, enmities, loves, and hatreds towards circumstances, events, or other dolls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/traps.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifTraps.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traps will help you catch conservative dolls; perhaps tempting them by turning on music or a television will make them react, allowing you to better interpret their tastes and appreciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/trust.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifTrust.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not trust their actions; these dolls are much smarter than you think. They are capable of moving others from their place and annihilating other dolls in order to confuse you, especially if you do not know each doll well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You might assume that everything is over if you find a single doll out of its box. However, it may not have moved on its own; another doll might have moved it, or even moved many others while it remains completely still.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/door.png?t=1746651041\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/extras/gifDoor.gif?t=1746651041\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's extremely important that you keep the door closed; failing to do so could have catastrophic consequences, from letting the impostor escape to altering the order of your eliminations, or even preventing you from making it through the night.</p>","developers":["David Gallardo"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2882870","name":"Doll Impostor"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703680/8a9951f405861ace19775bd4b361ac352bbbecf0/header.jpg?t=1746651041","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Doll Impostor \u00a9 2025 HeadArrow Studios All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257131268,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131268/movie480.mp4?t=1746582103","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131268/movie_max.mp4?t=1746582103"},"name":"Patrol Update","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257131268/49fa38cb16f43c8f9dc0e82f8b00613682091a4c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746582103","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131268/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746582103","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257131268/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746582103"}}],"name":"Doll Impostor: Free Sample","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit pro